Do not expose stack traces, SQL errors, internal file paths, access tokens, or database connection details.

Do not silently discard failed updates.

Do not display success notifications before the server confirms the operation.

Provide retry actions where appropriate.

If a profile request fails, do not replace the existing profile with fabricated fallback data.

